{"title":"Jackalhide Torso","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Leatherworking Lv 26) · Monster drop: Bosun Grell, Captain Corva Redmaw, Kobold Trapper</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Leatherworking at level 26 <span class=\"muted\">(1163 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/jackal-pelt\">Jackal Pelt</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"pirate-captain\" title=\"Captain Corva Redmaw - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/fb82810ccbbc9aa7410b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Captain Corva Redmaw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"pirate-bosun\" title=\"Bosun Grell - dropped it in 1 of 3 looted corpses (1/3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7b35448a2f581feca186.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bosun Grell</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"kobold-trapper\" title=\"Kobold Trapper - dropped it in 1 of 11 looted corpses (1/11)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/67e32c17ae4f4cf34bb9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kobold Trapper</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"jackalhide-torso\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/jackal-pelt\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/a527c3adeb957a426463.svg\" alt=\"\">Jackal Pelt</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/4fb018ef7eb4a35bbb32.svg\" alt=\"Jackalhide Torso\"></div><h3>Jackalhide Torso</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Leatherworking 26</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/26/2026, 8:40:23 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}